Installed components
--------------------

`shadwire add` copies component source into your application. Those installed
files are yours: use, modify and ship them in commercial and closed-source
products, with no attribution requirement on the copies and no runtime
dependency on Shadwire.

This is the point of the Open Code model, and it is stated here so that nobody
has to infer it from the MIT text. The notice requirement is satisfied by this
repository, which carries the notices below.


