Dependencies an installed component brings along
------------------------------------------------

None of these are vendored into Shadwire. They are declared so that anyone
auditing what reaches their application can see the whole chain is permissive.

    view_component      MIT   https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component
    lucide-rails        MIT   https://github.com/heyvito/lucide-rails
    Lucide (icon data)  ISC   https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
    Chart.js 4.4.6      MIT   https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js
                              (importmap pin, used by the chart component)

The CLI itself depends on Thor (MIT). It is a development-time tool and never
reaches your application's runtime.
